<p>\(\displaystyle \lim_{(x,y) \to ({@var_x@},{@var_y@})} {@question_func@} = \displaystyle \frac{\lim_{(x,y) \to  ({@var_x@},{@var_y@})}  ({@func_num@}))}{\lim_{(x,y) \to ({@var_x@},{@var_y@})}  ({@func_denom@})}={@ta2@}\) </p>
<p>Therefore, we can say that the limit of this function exists</p>]]></text>
